.TH uname 1 "2026-10-17" "Extrautils 0.0.3" "uname Manual"
.SH uname
uname \- display machine info
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uname
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uname
is a tool that prints out your machine info.

.BR -a \  --all: \  Display \  all \  information
.TP
.BR -n \  --node: \  Display \  node \  name
.TP
.BR -r \  --release: \  Kernel \  release
.TP
.BR -v \  --version: \  Kernel \  version
.TP
.BR -m \  --machine: \  Display \  machine
.TP
.BR -h \  --help: \  Show \  this \  help
.SH AUTHOR
